1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,452
Welcome to Aura Code. A modern model agnostic coding agent built for high performance development.

2
00:00:07,552 --> 00:00:15,988
Our Kanban board gives you complete visual control. Drag and drop task cards across columns with instant re parenting.

3
00:00:16,088 --> 00:00:24,356
The core philosophy is simple: Zero context switching. Everything happens inside one unified work window.

4
00:00:24,456 --> 00:00:32,124
The Execution List lets you search and filter through all tasks, monitoring status and tool usage in real time.

5
00:00:32,224 --> 00:00:38,092
Connect your automation ecosystem without writing a single line of integration glue code.

6
00:00:38,192 --> 00:00:47,156
Our Third Party Hub connects directly to n8n, Zapier, Make, Pipedream, Slack, Telegram, and REST webhooks.

7
00:00:47,256 --> 00:00:52,836
Design complex automation pipelines visually with our Workflow DAG engine.

8
00:00:52,936 --> 00:01:00,868
Build node graphs, configure tool actions, set human approval checkpoints, or switch to a linear Zapier mode.

9
00:01:00,968 --> 00:01:05,948
See your web apps come to life instantly inside the Web Studio Canvas.

10
00:01:06,048 --> 00:01:13,332
Run code live in a secure sandbox and preview layouts across mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports.

11
00:01:13,432 --> 00:01:18,196
Tackle massive refactors with parallel multi-agent Swarm mode.

12
00:01:18,296 --> 00:01:26,108
Specialized researcher, coder, and reviewer sub agents execute simultaneously in isolated git branches.

13
00:01:26,208 --> 00:01:30,900
Aura Code gets smarter over time with the Archimedes memory engine.

14
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:37,612
It tracks model competence per task domain and selects the optimal LLM provider automatically.

15
00:01:37,712 --> 00:01:45,308
Whether you love the fast Terminal UI or the Web Studio, Aura Code puts true agent autonomy at your fingertips.

